SUMMARY:Oops! We Lost a Nuke
LOCATION:Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:Oops! We Lost a Nuke is a comedic play set in the 1950s\, featu
 ring four characters performed – sometimes simultaneously – by two acto
 rs. When an unassuming pacifist abuses his position within the US governmen
 t in order to hide a nuclear warhead\, it becomes clear that his affair wit
 h his secretary and his wife's affair with her doctor are the least of thei
 r worries. As the government closes in\, secrets come to light.\nMore info:
  https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/oops-we-lost-a-nuke/
